{
  "title": "KLIA2美食：落地后去哪里吃",
  "slug": "klia2-food",
  "locale": "zh",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "metaDescription": "KLIA2美食攻略：吉隆坡机场吃什么？Gateway@klia2两个美食广场、各楼层餐馆铺位、24小时营业的店，以及1楼搭巴士。",
  "featureImage": "/images/blog/covers/klia2-food.jpg",
  "translationOf": {
    "locale": "en",
    "slug": "klia2-food"
  },
  "contentBlocks": [
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>KLIA2美食大多集中在Gateway@klia2，也就是你过了入境、提取行李和海关之后走进去的商场。2楼（Level 2）是入境层，有美食广场Food Arcade和大部分餐馆；3楼（Level 3）是出境层，有第二个美食广场Food District(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/floors.aspx?c=13&amp;f=3\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。吉隆坡机场吃什么？这篇按你落地后的位置来分：禁区（airside）、入境层、出境层，最后告诉你怎么吃完饭再从1楼搭巴士。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "重点速览"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>KLIA2的餐饮在哪里？</strong>大多在Gateway@klia2的公共区，2楼（入境层）和3楼（出境层）(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/floors.aspx?c=11&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>KLIA2有美食广场吗？</strong>有两个。Food Arcade在2楼，Food District在3楼。商场名录列明两个都24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=1261&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>落地后能在入境前吃东西吗？</strong>不要这样打算。禁区内的餐饮在登机廊和卫星楼（Satellite Building），要过了出境移民关卡才到得了(<a href=\"https://www.klia2.info/klia2/shops/food-and-beverages-shops/\">klia2.info</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>深夜有什么开着？</strong>Food Arcade、Food District和Memang Meow Kopitiam都列为24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=10341&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>是清真的吗？</strong>要看每家店。请在每个柜台找JAKIM清真证书(<a href=\"https://www.klia2.info/klia2/shops/food-and-beverages-shops/\">klia2.info</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "禁区（过了出境移民关卡）：给出境旅客"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>落地后，你从登机口走到移民关卡，然后提取行李、过海关，出来就是2楼。路线请看<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-arrival-hall\">KLIA2入境大厅指南</a>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>航站楼的禁区餐饮在登机廊和卫星楼，旅客要过了出境移民关卡才能到(<a href=\"https://www.klia2.info/klia2/shops/food-and-beverages-shops/\">klia2.info</a>)。Google Maps列出<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Oriental%20Kopi%20%E2%80%A2%20KLIA%202%20Boarding%20Hall&amp;query_place_id=ChIJv2ssxVG_zTERTX0hk3rvYhY\">Oriental Kopi KLIA 2 Boarding Hall</a>（登机大厅分店）位于S4-03-A05，International Departure Level（Airside）；也列出<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Asia%20Street%20Cooking%2C%20Gate%20P%20KLIA%20Terminal%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJr6yy_dq_zTERC_d_me220SQ\">Asia Street Cooking</a>在Gate P，类别为亚洲餐厅。这两家都是给出境或转机旅客的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>入境时把护照拿在手上，留着肚子到商场再吃。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "2楼：过了入境之后的KLIA2美食"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>过了海关，从B门（Door B）走出入境大厅，就进入Gateway@klia2。这里是2楼，商场名录里大部分餐馆和咖啡馆都在这一层(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/floors.aspx?c=11&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。Google Maps也列出<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=OLDTOWN%20White%20Coffee%20%40%20KLIA%202%20Arrival&amp;query_place_id=ChIJlSnyl7e_zTERRSUyt94Kags\">OLDTOWN White Coffee</a>，位于入境层公共区（Arrival Level, Public Concourse）的S2-2-1C05。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>Food Arcade</strong>是入境层的美食广场，位于L2-118和L2-120至L2-129。商场介绍说这是有冷气的用餐大厅，有本地和国际料理，24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=1261&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Grandmama%27s%20%7C%20KLIA%20T2%20Level%202%20Arrival&amp;query_place_id=ChIJR0-A0Su_zTERsOQuWrNqOD4\">Grandmama's</a>位于L2-75和L2-76，Google Maps类别为马来餐厅。商场介绍它是做传统菜的马来西亚餐馆，营业时间早上7点到晚上11点(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=12376&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Oriental%20Kopi%20%E2%80%A2%20KLIA%202%20Arrival%20Hall%20%5BLevel%202%5D&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ-VDqUEC_zTERTUmZbA9dowU\">Oriental Kopi</a>位于L2-58和L2-59。商场介绍它卖南洋料理，招牌是咖啡、葡式蛋挞和菠萝包(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=3309&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=DIN%20by%20Din%20Tai%20Fung%20at%20KLIA%20Terminal%202%20%28Arrival%29%20%5BNo%20Pork%20No%20Lard%5D&amp;query_place_id=ChIJE3SzJyK_zTER64Hdp1ouUFE\">DIN by Din Tai Fung</a>位于L2-92和L2-93，Google Maps类别为台湾菜和中餐馆。它在Google Maps上的店名写着“No Pork No Lard”（无猪肉无猪油），这是餐厅自己的说法，不是清真证书。商场列明营业时间早上6点到晚上11点(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=12369&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Nanyang%20Cafe%20%40%20KLIA%20Terminal%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJGda2maG_zTERc6O-2KNlzko\">Nanyang Cafe</a>位于L2-94和L2-95，商场资料提到港式云吞面和菠萝包，营业时间早上6点到午夜12点(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=3298&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Memang%20Meow%20%40%20Gateway%20KLIA%20Terminal%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJt7zkF1K_zTERtiQkp7d_2GU\">Memang Meow Kopitiam</a>位于L2-98、L2-101和L2-102A及B，卖本地和国际料理、咖啡和甜点。商场列为24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=10341&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Tea%20Garden%20Gateway%40KLIA2&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ99khM12_zTERseQbFk4G6Xs\">Tea Garden</a>位于L2-133和L2-134，卖南洋餐点和饮料，早上7点到晚上10点半(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=9336&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。它的官网写明马来西亚所有分店都有清真认证(<a href=\"https://www.teagarden.com.my/\">Tea Garden</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>以上营业时间来自商场名录，2026年11月5日查阅。先把这一层走一圈再决定吃什么。巴士柜台就在楼下1楼，详见<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-bus-station\">KLIA2巴士站指南</a>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "3楼：出境层公共区"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>3楼是出境大厅，还在出境移民关卡之前的公共区(<a href=\"https://www.klia2.info/klia2/shops/food-and-beverages-shops/\">klia2.info</a>)。不用登机证，从商场上楼就到。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>Food District</strong>是KLIA2的第二个美食广场，位于L3-33和L3-47至L3-50。商场列为24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=9338&amp;f=3\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Grandmama%E2%80%99s%20%7C%20KLIA%20T2%20Level%203%20Departure&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ2RyC98y_zTERaST_1jSjCYY\">Grandmama's</a>在L3-26还有一家分店。Google Maps把它列为清真餐厅，这是商家自己标注的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=NakNak%20KLIA%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJHSusm9C_zTERJehI4VoTGCY\">NakNak</a>位于L3-2和L3-3，Google Maps类别为韩国餐厅。商场介绍它卖韩式炸鸡、汉堡和满料薯条，早上10点到晚上10点(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=11349&amp;f=3\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Thong%20Bowl%20KLIA%20Terminal%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJI1amcgC_zTEROrRea9OQWBY\">Thong Bowl</a>位于L3-23和L3-24，卖泰国菜，早上9点到晚上9点(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=10335&amp;f=3\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Shake%20Shack%20KLIA2&amp;query_place_id=ChIJXSjbMOG_zTERhaEzpSu21wk\">Shake Shack</a>位于L3-30至L3-32，卖汉堡、鸡肉三明治和奶昔，早上10点到晚上10点(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=12364&amp;f=3\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>Google Maps还列出<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Serai%20Chicken%20Rice%20%40%20KLIA%20Terminal%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJwzJpcBu_zTERw6OJRd1qpds\">Serai Chicken Rice</a>，位于出境层公共区（Departure Level, Landside）S2-3-L03，以及在3楼出境大厅的<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Jollibee%20%40%20KLIA%20Terminal%202&amp;query_place_id=ChIJA1y5yNC_zTERRMXIR_wcy3U\">Jollibee</a>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>2楼人多的话，上一层楼吃，吃完再下到1楼搭巴士。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "KLIA2的清真和无猪肉餐饮"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>Gateway@klia2里清真和非清真的店并排开着。Google Maps上的“Halal restaurant”标签和“No Pork No Lard”招牌都是商家自己选的标注，都不是JAKIM证书。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>清真证书是按分店发的，不是按品牌；美食广场里每个档口也各自经营(<a href=\"https://www.klia2.info/klia2/shops/food-and-beverages-shops/\">klia2.info</a>)。点餐前先看墙上的证书。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "先吃饭，再搭巴士"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>去KL Sentral、Pudu Sentral、Lalaport BBCC和TBS的巴士都从1楼的交通枢纽（Transportation Hub）出发(<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/klia2-to-kl-sentral\">ttklia.com</a>)。2026年11月5日下午查看时，KLIA2到KL Sentral的页面列出每15到30分钟一班，直到晚上11点45分(<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/klia2-to-kl-sentral\">ttklia.com</a>)。车票价格以订票页面为准。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>订一班比你预计出海关时间晚一小时左右的巴士，就有时间在2楼吃饭再走下楼。不想拖着行李吃饭？<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-luggage-storage\">KLIA2行李寄存指南</a>列出2楼和1楼的寄存柜台。午夜后才落地？24小时美食广场照样开，<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-capsule-hotel\">KLIA2胶囊酒店指南</a>比较了在机场过夜和直接进城两种做法。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "cta",
      "content": {
        "heading": "在KLIA2吃饱，再搭巴士",
        "subheading": "选好从KLIA2到KL Sentral、Pudu Sentral、Lalaport BBCC或其他地方的巴士，电子车票存在手机里。",
        "buttonText": "查看KLIA2巴士",
        "url": "https://ttklia.com/bus/destinations?utm_source=teeko&utm_medium=blog&utm_campaign=klia2_food&utm_content=zh"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "常见问题"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2有美食广场吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>有两个。Food Arcade在2楼入境层，Food District在3楼。Gateway@klia2名录列明两个都24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=9338&amp;f=3\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2过了入境在哪里吃？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>在Gateway@klia2。从B门走出入境大厅就是2楼，大部分餐馆都在这里。3楼也是公共区(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/floors.aspx?c=11&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2有哪些24小时营业的餐饮？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>商场名录列明Food Arcade、Food District和Memang Meow Kopitiam是24小时营业(<a href=\"https://www.gatewayklia2.com.my/directory/store.aspx?c=4&amp;tid=10341&amp;f=2\">Gateway@klia2</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "落地后能在KLIA2禁区吃东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>请打算过了入境再吃。禁区餐饮在登机廊和卫星楼，要过出境移民关卡才到得了(<a href=\"https://www.klia2.info/klia2/shops/food-and-beverages-shops/\">klia2.info</a>)。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2的DIN by Din Tai Fung是清真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>它在Google Maps上的店名写着“No Pork No Lard”，这是餐厅自己的说法，不是清真证书。需要JAKIM认证的话，请在柜台询问。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2有清真食物吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>有，但要逐家确认。Tea Garden官网写明其马来西亚分店有清真认证(<a href=\"https://www.teagarden.com.my/\">Tea Garden</a>)。其他店请在柜台找JAKIM证书。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "总结"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>KLIA2美食在Gateway@klia2的2楼和3楼，过了入境就到，有两个24小时美食广场，餐馆都按铺位号码找得到。营业时间会变，出发前请打开每家店的Google Maps链接确认。然后<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/klia2-to-kl-sentral?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=klia2_food&amp;utm_content=zh\">在ttklia.com订KLIA2到KL Sentral的巴士</a>，等车的时候去吃饭。</p>"
    }
  ]
}
